/T (% Kernel matrix Omega for i=1:n, for j=1:n   Kmat\(i,j\) = K\(Xtr\(i,:\), Xtr\(j,:\)\); end, end Omega = \(y_tr*y_tr'\) .* Kmat;)
/E (% Kernel matrix Omega for i=1:n, for j=1:n   Kmat\(i,j\) = K\(Xtr\(i,:\), Xtr\(j,:\)\); end, end Omega = \(y_tr*y_tr'\) .* Kmat;)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [15]
>>
